// PM40 (rule `ad-checkpoint v1`, opt-in) DECLINES: the full tape REPLAYS the
// step value in its descending sweep, reading `forcing` LIVE -- and `forcing`
// is the gradient buffer, which the reverse sweep has already moved from 2
// to 0, so `lgamma(forcing(0))` fails there (BL8008). A checkpointed replay
